The plate is square, about 26 cm across in the image (roughly 450 px), so about 58 px per cm. The food spans about 330 px by 150 px, which is roughly 12 cm by 6 cm. Most of it is a thin layer, perhaps 2-3 cm high at its thickest.

The food looks like a roasted chicken piece with skin, plus shredded, stewed meat with some onion. I estimate the chicken piece at about 70 g and the shredded meat at about 110 g, so roughly 180 g in total. Calories for that mix come to about 70 g × 2 kcal/g = 140 kcal for the chicken, plus 110 g × 1.8 kcal/g ≈ 200 kcal for the meat, so about 340 kcal. I'll lower that slightly to 320 kcal.

